# Build context exclusions for the developer-preview image (Dockerfile).
#
# Two of these matter for more than build speed:
#   .env.local  — never bake a developer's real signing keys into an image
#   node_modules — host modules may be built for a different platform/libc

.git
.github
.worktrees
.flox
.claude

node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__

.turbo
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage

.env.local
.env.local.*
**/.env
**/.env.local

test-results
**/test-results
playwright-report
**/playwright-report
**/logs
**/*.log

designs
screenshots
